    "## 1.2. Corpus Ingestion and Filtering\n",
    "\n",
    "This cell builds the working StressID speech table from `labels.csv`, located in the root directory of the dataset (`STRESSID_ROOT/labels.csv`). As described by the StressID authors, the binary labels were derived from the participants’ task-level self-assessments of perceived stress, reported on a scale from 0 to 10. Ratings below 5 were assigned to the **non-stressed** class (`0`), whereas ratings equal to or greater than 5 were assigned to the **stressed** class (`1`) [StressID paper, p. 6].\n",
    "\n",
